{"about_the_game":"RADtv is a quick fire, hot-seat, multiplayer VR party game that takes full advantage of VR\u2019s immersive and intuitive interactivity. Strap on your headset, smash your friend\u2019s scores to pieces and claim ultimate victory! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/649240/extras/51377c47ed2371a97c04c279f01593c5.poster.avif?t=1564770095\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/649240/extras/51377c47ed2371a97c04c279f01593c5.webm?t=1564770095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/649240/extras/51377c47ed2371a97c04c279f01593c5.mp4?t=1564770095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You and your friends are sucked into a sentient TV \u2013 transporting you into a virtual world of weird and wonderful settings, where your mental and physical skills are tested in 25 hugely varied rapid-fire games! If you\u2019ve always wanted to throw peas in to your hungry child\u2019s mouth, or perhaps toss vinyls at roaming zombies to avoid getting red on you, well we have you covered! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/649240/extras/af20ed2c01bfb1e0ca48a3113410618b.poster.avif?t=1564770095\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/649240/extras/af20ed2c01bfb1e0ca48a3113410618b.webm?t=1564770095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/649240/extras/af20ed2c01bfb1e0ca48a3113410618b.mp4?t=1564770095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>From cleanly slicing champagne bottles open to quick draws against cowboys to speed eating burgers - the situation changes as quickly as surfing TV Channels. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/649240/extras/b3730eb1e0645bb0b3b4e07455dcb85c.poster.avif?t=1564770095\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/649240/extras/b3730eb1e0645bb0b3b4e07455dcb85c.webm?t=1564770095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/649240/extras/b3730eb1e0645bb0b3b4e07455dcb85c.mp4?t=1564770095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Prepare to get sweaty with your friends as you compete for the best score and maximum points in each game. Whoever sits atop the Leaderboard at the end of the tournament becomes the RADtv champ!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/649240/extras/8a8eb0943038e6f395dd0a433cb56325.poster.avif?t=1564770095\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/649240/extras/8a8eb0943038e6f395dd0a433cb56325.webm?t=1564770095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/649240/extras/8a8eb0943038e6f395dd0a433cb56325.mp4?t=1564770095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/649240/extras/6d2b748e8e0377ac718e874d9fd941a8.avif?t=1564770095\" width=444 height=118 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\t25 Hugely Varied Games<br></li><li>\t5 Environment themes<br></li><li>\t2 to 6 Player Hot Seat local multiplayer<br></li><li>\tSingle player challenge mode with 100 challenges to complete<br></li><li>\t24 sets of player hands to unlock for customisation<br></li><li>\t1 set of player feet for hands (everyone loves feet, right?)</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/649240?t=1564770095","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/649240?t=1564770095","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/649240/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1564770095","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/649240/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1564770095","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Contains cartoon violence "},"detailed_description":"RADtv is a quick fire, hot-seat, multiplayer VR party game that takes full advantage of VR\u2019s immersive and intuitive interactivity. Strap on your headset, smash your friend\u2019s scores to pieces and claim ultimate victory! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/649240/extras/51377c47ed2371a97c04c279f01593c5.poster.avif?t=1564770095\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/649240/extras/51377c47ed2371a97c04c279f01593c5.webm?t=1564770095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/649240/extras/51377c47ed2371a97c04c279f01593c5.mp4?t=1564770095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You and your friends are sucked into a sentient TV \u2013 transporting you into a virtual world of weird and wonderful 